## Tor client for the chat tab's web search (scripts\start-tor.ps1).
## SOCKS on loopback only; the LangGraph orchestrator is the only client (socks5h://127.0.0.1:9050).
## DataDirectory and the log file are passed on the command line because their paths are machine-specific.
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
SocksPolicy accept 127.0.0.1
SocksPolicy reject *
ClientOnly 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
## Streams with different SOCKS credentials use different circuits (SocksPort's default IsolateSOCKSAuth);
## the orchestrator sends one credential per search branch.
